{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>41歲前TVB花旦楊秀惠2019年與圈外富貴男友葉世揚結婚，翌年拍完《十八年後的終極告白》後約滿離巢並淡出演藝圈，轉型從商，專心打理美容生意，短短幾年生意額已突破1億！惟楊秀惠嫁入豪門後嘆照顧小孩不易，面容憔悴不少。楊秀惠日前再拍片分享，曾經試過暴食，又試過食西藥減肥，導致體重及情緒失控。</p><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠大肚都好靚。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250727/1026199538630922240248706.jpeg/1HxToBlhoHXGBb2QCWen_TVJLrdwxEke5KrvEOSq7xA\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠大肚都好靚。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠曬最愛手袋！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250313/976988198536220672508193.jpeg/vXZ9ioHzd_lM1AkaacNFGdz-neOxgYNhqc9Pp6nPT6c\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠曬最愛手袋！</figcaption></figure><p>楊秀惠暴食體重情緒失控：食西藥減肥</p><p>楊秀惠近日拍片透露，她初來港發展時並非一帆風順。她憶述當年隻身來港發展，身邊「無人無物」，加上不懂說廣東話，她指：「其實嗰種無助，真係有啲令人好驚。」楊秀惠指剛開始拍劇時面對很多微小而無形的壓力，只識靠食嘢減壓，「唔係因為肚餓，而係因為好多嘢控制唔到，而食嘢係我唯一覺得控制得到，又短暫帶畀我快樂，同埋減壓嘅方法。」</p><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠好瘦！（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250220/969383420134166528567182.jpeg/gXEge0MeDqx57AslfClBN7GcjuhldiwjmTWjS5k1o0s\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠好瘦！（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠生細仔後坐完月，仍似足少女。（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250224/970734427741229056293481.jpeg/ZXnNvJubwJ-O2eN8Sv8PMo_MEO6wpja_C1zPlQtcz5U\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠生細仔後坐完月，仍似足少女。（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠好靚！（小紅書@楊秀惠）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073313750297088000024891.png/ly9zji9s_IA3hsY7YQk745y4gmj4rhKg0MUfCNDFHwg\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠好靚！（小紅書@楊秀惠）</figcaption></figure><p>可是拍劇需要控制體重，楊秀惠選擇食西藥減肥，「後果當然係情緒同健康都好差。」楊秀惠形容當時「無助到極點」。楊秀惠指暴食時期的她感到人生不受控，直至一日她想通，要為人生負責，故開始善待自己。</p><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠透露曾經試過暴食導致情緒體重失控。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138511571396595712719056.png/f9rHVMrJe2YViOBfTDXMwQ2RvXbC2I78V2udEldrnRI\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠透露曾經試過暴食導致情緒體重失控。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠靠食西藥減肥。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138511569207037952748651.png/gmarDo3KbLcEkhiWg6evg-6Q3qmeLSSDzkl9cM5JfXA\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠靠食西藥減肥。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠分享個人經歷。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138511567139115008850312.png/2reMWonTfVQZ2gOVjx7JHzwXe_HFCXCUy6TaJcuk2iU\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠分享個人經歷。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213108730138624254310.jpeg/3pEtrNMzS6YnYsu7xEAPqWoZ0vc-d_3XLCoSbSwqEm0\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213108893716480635742.jpeg/aIlqSp4NYlhYmFcxYBynzJcsANoUGFGZAcDB0wHAwdM\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213112761126912238519.jpeg/918X2nuIaWFiOWNJvIEFeluiEFOXEMZnLmMfWS5jH1k\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213111418818560087536.jpeg/sSvGbM2gvnHFeBB9eppkgt3NLPM6bPtsSVj8T0lY_E8\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213118360915968796483.jpeg/3zOqI9xDfXLdOULzUAAAmf38SQlHsQzcIyFhtiMhYbY\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213120718245888405631.jpeg/p1BzNjtHKdoHM4NPt53zAmCPlKz7-sYWAoTGUAKExlA\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213118369304576871035.jpeg/ybLEGyKZWBteL1oq8eQSQFlvRn9sDBm5ZL7C-mS-wvo\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213119912677376169028.jpeg/yEXzq_CTyWfgtx-y0NXw087uen18bRUDgkLGOIJCxjg\"/><figcaption>靚（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213115563053056638549.jpeg/lg4ksVT4GvsUdItzZu0jcPi5607mZMafYcKJs2HCibM\"/><figcaption>靚（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213113956503552139027.jpeg/AYIFB3mmioGjU86yqYJ6DXs0fZGW3QbyvfP5gL3z-YA\"/><figcaption>靚（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠細仔頭髮濃密。（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250204/963401988249227264951638.jpeg/_OvdUZe05sDQty3TNN5W10Cut9C6aPJ08LsmU_C7JlM\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠細仔頭髮濃密。（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠好靚女！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250313/976988332976246784178690.jpeg/bpEPPrUZ41eFEemuN5a2d1pbJrcPtoQBEN5vIxDebyM\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠好靚女！</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠曬極速瘦身成果。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250313/976988480796102656625389.jpeg/HPiyqoAw3vJh55D73z5e5NbD_mQmRuDlHPZu3Rz2bt0\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠曬極速瘦身成果。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊秀惠生細仔後坐完月，仍似足少女。（IG@vvyeo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250224/970734425161601024186430.jpeg/e1KbYTXOYxJ6Y0WWaj6emPjX1kiQToOIkIhx1pCIcdY\"/><figcaption>楊秀惠生細仔後坐完月，仍似足少女。（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T22:18:55.145110+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":761,"images":22,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}